{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are food.</strong>  <br> <br>As a Helminth\u2014a native inhabitant of the depths of one of Jupiter's moons\u2014you and your brothers, sisters, and offspring provide humans a lot of protein. <strong>And yes, you are tasty.</strong> But do you want to end up in the stomach of a gluttonous humans? Or will you find a way out?<i> </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/d0c00897d13ed7b5f183733c3c2b11af.poster.avif?t=1759055605\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/d0c00897d13ed7b5f183733c3c2b11af.webm?t=1759055605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/d0c00897d13ed7b5f183733c3c2b11af.mp4?t=1759055605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Helminths</strong>\u00a0is a linear platformer set within a vast mining complex that produces the galaxy's most delicious canned food. The unfortunate part? You're the main ingredient. Uncover the secrets of this industrial complex, where Helminths are mined, processed and canned. <strong>Navigate the deadly human facility by mastering precision platforming and environmental puzzle-solving to achieve your escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/ce47ea8e35bd8e1f0a267df2c1ce8008.poster.avif?t=1759055605\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/ce47ea8e35bd8e1f0a267df2c1ce8008.webm?t=1759055605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the hunter, not the prey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control each character</strong> you encounter through the unique ability to penetrate bodies. Use different character abilities to avoid obstacles, fight... Or use them as a trampoline for higher jumps. Whether you're slipping past guards unnoticed or taking control workers to access restricted areas, strategic use of this power is <strong>essential for your escape</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/ae27fa503090feaa5ec007e825ad9ce6.poster.avif?t=1759055605\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/ae27fa503090feaa5ec007e825ad9ce6.webm?t=1759055605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ levels combining <strong>fast-paced action</strong> with <strong>environmental puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control each character and use their <strong>unique abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a <strong>dark dystopian vision of the future</strong> in an industrial complex on an alien planet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted</strong> 2D pixel art graphics and dynamic lights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3283690?t=1759055605","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3283690?t=1759055605","capsu