ood. The unfortunate part? You're the main ingredient. Uncover the secrets of this industrial complex, where Helminths are mined, processed and canned. <strong>Navigate the deadly human facility by mastering precision platforming and environmental puzzle-solving to achieve your escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/ce47ea8e35bd8e1f0a267df2c1ce8008.poster.avif?t=1759055605\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/ce47ea8e35bd8e1f0a267df2c1ce8008.webm?t=1759055605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the hunter, not the prey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control each character</strong> you encounter through the unique ability to penetrate bodies. Use different character abilities to avoid obstacles, fight... Or use them as a trampoline for higher jumps. Whether you're slipping past guards unnoticed or taking control workers to access restricted areas, strategic use of this power is <strong>essential for your escape</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/ae27fa503090feaa5ec007e825ad9ce6.poster.avif?t=1759055605\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283690/extras/ae27fa503090feaa5ec007e825ad9ce6.webm?t=1759055605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ levels combining <stron